    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολῐχ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολιχοδρομέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.82
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>): generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμον δ.</span>
			<i>go through a long</i> course, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.331
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν φύσιν</span>
			<i>prolong</i> its existence, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πολλοὺς πλοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			.</div>
